OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers across northern
OL,6,FScotland, elsewhere will be fine, dry
OL,7,Fand warmer than Saturday, especially
OL,8,Facross England and Wales. Increasing
OL,9,Fcloud in some western areas may bring
OL,10,Fthe odd spot of rain later, but many
OL,11,Fplaces will stay dry.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud will increase across
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland, Scotland and
OL,15,Fnorthern England, bringing some
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain. Elsewhere, it will
OL,17,Fstay mostly dry with clear spells,
OL,18,Fparticularly across southern and
OL,19,Feastern areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
