OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FRain spreads north across
OL,6,FScotland, with heavier showers
OL,7,Fpossible in Northern Ireland. Many
OL,8,Fother areas remain dry with sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Feeling hot in the southeast,
OL,10,Fwith a chance of thunderstorm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
